id: pawn-shell
name: Pawn
order: 6
optionOf: difference-in-shell
optionEffect: 2
# Pieces of the Hive's Pawn chosen: this one.
follows: pawn
description: >
  If your Insect Shell is broken, increase your Combat rolls by 1/2 of its Apparel Bonus (rounded up) until the end of your next turn.
text: >
  Pawn [Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If your Insect Shell is broken, increase your Combat rolls by 1/2 of its Apparel Bonus (rounded up) until the end of your next turn.

---

# Broken in a Combat Encounter: asked, once an Encounter - half its Apparel Bonus (rounded up) on your Combat Rolls till the end of your
# next turn, as Sturdy Shell's (5) (dbu-ttrpg.mjs shellBroken; Shell Burst, its mark).
[passive]
allow shell.burst;
